* "German Lead 650" power amp (the ENGL E650 II drawing): C20 and the long-tailed ECC83 phase inverter V4 (cathodes joined through R47 470R; the tail and the
* feedback network R48 22k / R49 1.5k / R50 3.3k with C23, R51 150k and C21 100n to V4B's grid, as on the drawing), four 5881 as two parallel pairs (2.2k grid stoppers,
* 470R screen resistors, 330k grid returns to the bias supply, cathodes to ground through the standby switch, closed here), the output transformer with its 16, 8 and 4 ohm
* sections, and the HT supply. The negative feedback comes from the 8 ohm tap through R52 56k and the LEAD PRESENCE pot P6 (a series rheostat: more resistance, less
* feedback, more presence); the clean channel's fixed R54 220k cannot be switched from here (it is the preamp's channel relay) so the presence pot always applies.

S VAUDIO pin 50k 0
S VHT a 1 460
S VBIAS bias 100 -47.5

C C20 pin ga 100n
R R44 ga j 100k
R R47 kk j 470
T V4A ga pa kk 12AX7
T V4B gb pb kk 12AX7
R R48 j n1 22k
R R49 n1 n2 1.5k
R R50 n2 0 3.3k
C C23 n2 0 47n
R R51 j gb 150k
C C21 gb n1 100n
R R55 c pa 82k
R R56 c pb 100k

* Presence (a complementary pair: VRPS is the series rheostat, VRPD an unused dummy), R52, to the feedback node n1.
R VRPD pdum 0 100k
R VRPS t8 pp 1k
R R52 pp n1 56k

* Power-tube grids: coupling C25 / C26 from V4A's plate and C27 / C28 from V4B's, 330k returns to the bias supply (R57..R60) and 2.2k stoppers (R61..R64).
C C25 pa dt 94n
C C27 pb db 94n
R R57_58 dt bias 165k
R R59_60 bias db 165k
C CBIAS bias 0 47u

R R61_62 dt g45 2.2k/2
R R63_64 db g67 2.2k/2
P V5 g45 pt s45 0 6L6GCDS 2
P V6 g67 pbm s67 0 6L6GCDS 2
R R65_66 sb s45 470/2
R R67_68 sb s67 470/2

* Output transformer: plate-to-plate 2.8k, 3.5 H per primary half; windings are primary halves, then the 16 / 8 / 4 ohm sections of the secondary.
R DCR_PT pt npt 40
R DCR_PBM pbm npb 40
.param n16 = 2*1/sqrt(2800/16)
.xfmr OT L=3.5 SAT=4.7
  W npt a 1 pri
  W a npb 1 pri
  W t16 t8 0.2929*n16 sec
  W t8 t4 0.2071*n16 sec
  W t4 0 0.5*n16 sec
  K pri pri 0.9998
  K pri sec 0.9993
  K sec sec 0.9998
.end
R RLOAD t8 0 8

* HT supply: reservoir A, choke DCR, B (screens), then C (V4 plates) and D (the preamp's rail).
R T3 a sb 100
C C84 sb 0 47u
R R84 sb c 4.7k
C C85 c 0 47u
R R85S c x 4.7k
C C86 x 0 47u
R RPREAMP x 0 70k
